cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  accessible-surfaceome: an LLM-curated atlas of the
  accessible human surfaceome
message: >-
  If you use this software or the atlas it produces, please
  cite it using the metadata below. Cite a concept DOI
  (10.5281/zenodo.22116981 for the software, 10.5281/zenodo.20805383
  for the data) when you mean "the resource"; cite a version DOI when
  you mean a specific snapshot you actually ran against.
type: software
